  "text": "Your Cart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nBrowse our products and add items to get started.\n\nShop Products\nDistributor & Clinic Enquiries Open\n|\nWhatsApp Us\nSPARK-DV\nINNOVATING THE FUTURE\nHome\nProducts\nScience\nSchool Program\nFor Dentists\nFor Parents\nAbout\nContact\nRequest Pricing\nBook a Demo\nINNOVATING THE FUTURE\nInnovating the Future of Pediatric & Preventive Dentistry\n\nClinically oriented products designed for high-risk caries management, pediatric endodontics, and aesthetic pediatric restorations.\n\nRequest Distributor Pricing\nTalk to a Specialist\nMade in India\nDentist-Oriented\nEvidence-Led\nR&D Led\nScience-First\nDentist\nOriented\nPatented\nTechnology\nIndia\nMade In\nEvidence-Led Formulations\nNon-Staining Formulations\nPediatric-Friendly\nProfessional Protocols\nQuality-First Manufacturing\nProduct Family\nComplete Product Portfolio\n\nFrom daily prevention to specialized pediatric endodontics and restorations — 13 products designed for clinical impact.\n\nNSF TOOTHPASTE\nNanion\n\nNano Silver Fluoride toothpaste with triple-action technology — antibacterial, biofilm disruption, and sustained remineralization.\n\nLite\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n2% NSF\nElite\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n3% NSF\nNSF + 5% NHA DUAL-MATRIX\nNanion Pro\n\nFour-action dual-matrix: NSF antibacterial + biofilm disruption + sustained F⁻ release + nHA biomimetic repair and tubule occlusion.\n\nLite Pro\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n2% NSF + 5% nHA\nElite Pro\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n3% NSF + 5% nHA\nNSF MOUTHRINSE\nNanion Swish\n\nAdjunct for plaque and biofilm control. Alcohol-free, gentle rinse for orthodontics and high-risk maintenance.\n\nLearn More\nBIOACTIVE OBTURATION\nP-Obtura Bio-Activ\n\nBioactive obturation solution for pediatric endodontics. Professional use only.\n\nLearn More\nBIOCERAMIC SYSTEM\nNanohybrid Biocem\n\nBioactive, moisture-tolerant bioceramic system for pediatric endodontics. Professional use only.\n\nLearn More\nPEDIATRIC AESTHETIC CROWNS\nMARC 3D Crowns\n\nMinimally invasive, aesthetic, resilient 3D crowns for pediatric dentistry.\n\nLearn More\nPEDIATRIC ZIRCONIA CROWNS\nMARC Zirc Crowns\n\nBio engineered for superior anatomy design — combining aesthetic translucency with robust structural strength for modern pediatric practice.\n\nLearn More\nCOMING SOON\nTRIPLE ANTIBIOTIC CAPSULE\nTRICURE\n\nEndodontic adjunct for professional use. As per clinician judgment — refer to IFU.\n\nLaunching Soon\nPROFESSIONAL NSF APPLICATION\nNano Silver Pro\n\nTri-component caries prevention — nanosilver, NaF, and chitosan sustained-release matrix. 81–89% arrest rate.\n\nLearn More\nRESIN FLEX POST\n3D FLXPOST\n\nCAD-engineered prefabricated endodontic post with dentin-like modulus and macro-retention spiral flutes.\n\nLearn More\nORAL HEALTH GUMMIES\nNanion Pro Plus Gummies\n\n4-layer science-led gummy — probiotics, prebiotics, P114 peptide & L-arginine. Delicious strawberry flavour.\n\nLearn More\nADVANCED SPACE MAINTAINER\nASM\n\n3D preformed resin pedodontic bondable space maintainer — digitally engineered arch-space preservation.\n\nLearn More\nBLACK OXIDE NITI ENDO FILES\nSPARK DV Files\n\nBlack Gold and Black Oxide surface-engineered NiTi rotary files for primary and permanent teeth — single, three-file and permanent systems.\n\nPedo Single\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n₹2,200/-₹4,400/-\nPedo Three\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n₹1,800/-₹3,600/-\nEndo Spark\nLAUNCHING OFFER\n₹1,500/-₹3,000/-\nWHY SPARK-DV\nThree Pillars of Excellence\n\nInnovation, clinical practicality, and uncompromising quality — the foundation of every SPARK-DV product.\n\n01\nScience-Led Formulations\n\nEvery product is built on peer-reviewed research and clinically oriented evidence.\n\n02\nPractical Clinical Protocols\n\nStep-by-step chairside guides designed to integrate seamlessly into pediatric and preventive workflows.\n\n03\nSafety & Quality Manufacturing\n\nManufactured to rigorous quality standards. Made in India with commitment to safety and efficacy.\n\nFeatured Clinical Highlights\nBiofilm + Enamel Defense\n\nA combined approach that helps reduce biofilm burden while supporting natural remineralization.\n\nHigh-Risk Patient Focus\n\nDesigned for orthodontics, white spots, recurrent caries, and ECC — where prevention matters most.\n\nPediatric Workflow Optimized\n\nTime-saving handling, moisture tolerance where relevant, and clinician-friendly protocols.\n\nExplore the Science\nCOMMUNITY INITIATIVE\nSchool Dental Health Preventive Program\n\nPartner with SPARK-DV to protect youngsters, promote oral hygiene, and grow your practice with premium preventive dental care delivered right inside schools.\n\nNSF professional application administered by partner dentists\nNanion Toothpaste — premium advanced oral care for every student\nHealthy Smile certificate from SPARK-DV\nMinimum 1,000 students per school, with a 60/40 partner share\nExplore the Program\nWHO IT'S FOR\nSolutions for Every Stakeholder\n\nWhether you're a dental professional, a parent, or a distributor — SPARK-DV has resources tailored for you.\n\nFor Dentists\n\nClinical protocols, evidence library, indications, and professional resources.\n\nClinical Resources\nFor Parents\n\nSimple benefits, safety information, how-to-use guides, and FAQs.\n\nLearn More\nFor Distributors\n\nProduct catalog, pricing enquiry, and partnership opportunities.\n\nRequest Pricing\nWhat People Say\n\nExperiences from our community of professionals, parents, and partners.\n\n\"SPARK-DV products have helped streamline my pediatric workflow. The clinical protocols are practical and well-researched.\"\n\nDPS\n\nDr. P. Sharma\n\nPediatric Dentist\n\n\"As a parent, I appreciate the clear safety information and easy-to-follow guidance for my child's oral care.\"\n\nMAR\n\nMrs. A. Reddy\n\nParent\n\n\"The product range is comprehensive and the distribution support is excellent. A reliable partner for our network.\"\n\nMKP\n\nMr. K. Patel\n\nDistribution Partner\n\nReady to Partner with SPARK-DV?\n\nRequest distributor pricing, schedule a clinical demo, or get in touch with our team.\n\nRequest Distributor Pricing\nBook a Demo\nSPARK-DV\nINNOVATING THE FUTURE\n\nClinically oriented products for caries management, pediatric endodontics, and restorations. Made in India.\n\nProducts\nNanion Lite\nNanion Elite\nNanion Swish\nP-Obtura Bio-Activ\nNanohybrid Biocem\nMARC 3D Crowns\nTRICURE\nCompany\nAbout Us\nScience & Research\nFor Dentists\nFor Parents\nContact\nContact\nsparkdv310@gmail.com\n+91 7981546939 / 9154741994 / 9848014443\nChennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nREGULATORY / LABEL INFORMATION\n\nManufactured by: 3K NANO PVT. LTD., HNO-RZ-625/1C, KH-625, T/F/L/S, Indra Park, Palam Colony, New Delhi, Delhi 110045\nManufactured for: SPARK-DV\nMarketed by: Sendan Pharmaceuticals Pvt. Ltd., Chennai, Tamil Nadu🇮🇳 Made in India\n\n© 2026 SPARK-DV. All rights reserved.\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service\nShipping & Returns\n\nDisclaimer: Products listed support oral hygiene and preventive care. Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Consult a qualified dental professional. For children, use under adult supervision. Keep out of reach of children. Do not swallow.\n\nChat with us",
